                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">Insights is an advanced analytics engine that lets you explore and visualize data to better inform decisions and understand the overall impact of all of your campaigns. You can access data across all campaign groups within your account, see your data as bar graphs or line charts, and configure dimensions and metrics in different ways to meet your needs.</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































