                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">Average cost-per-thousand-impressions (CPM) is the average amount you pay per one thousand ad impressions on the App Store.</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































