                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">Tap-through conversion rate (CR) is total installs resulting from taps on your ad divided by the total number of taps within the reporting period.</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































