                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">The number of times your ad was shown in any ad position for a specific search term, out of the total number of searches on that search term, in the same App Store countries and regions. Impression share is shown as an exact percentage from 0–90%. Once it exceeds 90%, it’s shown as 91–100%. This metric is only available in predefined Impression Share reports and on the Recommendations page.</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































