					<h3 class="article-copy-block--label ">Pre-orders Placed (View-Through)</h3>
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">The total number of pre-orders placed from users who viewed your ad, but didn’t tap it. A pre-order placed (view-through) is counted within 24 hours of viewing your ad, and within 60 days of the app download. This does not account for any pre-orders canceled after the pre-order has been placed.</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































</section>
